Subject: Re: [stan-users] Estimate a model with a long vector of latent discrete parameters in Stan
Message-ID: <N4bb-zz9-Jo.RToMf4V0CgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <N4bb-zz9-Jo.hsf0UZlvCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <N4bb-zz9-Jo.hsf0UZlvCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/N4bb-zz9-Jo/m/RToMf4V0CgAJ>
