Subject: Re: [stan-users] Problems with non-linear mixed effects model and AR(1) structure
Message-ID: <RmTSUl3MjWw.HNfWnQ8TCwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/RmTSUl3MjWw/m/HNfWnQ8TCwAJ>
