Subject: Re: [stan-users] Finding transition times
Message-ID: <gN-cX2EwIIw.qubUJXt6AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <gN-cX2EwIIw.Xp-eBKNqAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
