Subject: Sparse regression using horseshoe priors and small effects
Message-ID: <a1V0gdarmaY.xu-9qA7gAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <a1V0gdarmaY.XKsm0c6xAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <a1V0gdarmaY.XKsm0c6xAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
