MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The weak stationary condition for an ARMA(2,1) are:

-1 < phi2 < 1
 -sqrt(1 - 2 phi2 + phi2^2) < phi1 < sqrt( 1 - 2 phi2 + phi2^2)

I'm not sure this apply to your model.

Andre

