Subject: Re: [stan-users] Error Covariance Structure of Linear Multilevel Model for Change
Message-ID: <mBByoWS7Nwg.DzYmnil0AgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <mBByoWS7Nwg.2XRlQItfAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
