These are probably causing your divergent transitions
as the scale is very constrained:

  alpha[1] ~ normal(0.001,0.0001);
  alpha[2] ~ normal(0.005,0.0001);
  rho[1] ~ normal(0.95,0.01);
  rho[2] ~ normal(0.3,0.01);

We recommend converting anything you can to unit scale.  It
takes a lot of the pressure off Stan's adaptation.

- Bob

