Subject: can I make posterior predictions in rstanarm and exclude the variance from an effect I don't care about?
Message-ID: <bA_MXmWbicw.DB_FuYY-BgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/bA_MXmWbicw/m/DB_FuYY-BgAJ>
