>
> and nothing gets printed, I get warning at the end of the stan execution that

Inequality constraints on objects declared in transformed parameters are validated at the end of the transformed parameters block. Thus, on these 13 iterations, the Hamiltonian process was terminated before reaching the model block where your print statement occurs.

Ben

