Subject: Re: [stan-users] Advice on optimizing Stan code: Nested mixed logit
Message-ID: <r-WGDouvg2c.XTD5rPjzBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <r-WGDouvg2c.YKcaV-LABgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <r-WGDouvg2c.YKcaV-LABgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
